      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just mute them, the people I've encountered like that are usually playing that song into their voice chat as well....\n\nFor feature requests its very important to be verbose. I'm not sure if you want to hide text chat from OSC in general or user specific, but another feature request I've seen is to block text chat from certain people, leave them unmuted audio-wise, but mute their text.\n\nBlocking all OSC text is great until someone wants to use OSC text for its original intended purposes",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
