      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Another approach is proposed here that's a less nuclear option than hiding all OSC chat: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-option-to-define-low-priority-osc-chatbox-messages\n\nCombined with per-user chat hiding (https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/1222-indivual-user-override-for-chatbox-visibility) I think it'd be a pretty decent solution.",
